    "name": "Talif's Journey",
    "steam_appid": 1145400,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/747e3a230bcea7a50154eac5341bc0a5.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Talif is an Apprentice on his way to becoming a Wizard. Heed the Archmage and traverse the island's 4 Dungeons, and collect the 4 Elemental Gifts, uncovering the secrets of the Wizard's island.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/f3d10625e8705b9c87b67cc1d86c98b7.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Talif casts magic by using four elemental orbs: fire, earth, water, and wind. Discover scrolls across the island to learn new combinations, and take advantage of your enemies' weaknesses. Check your <strong>Spellbook </strong>to see what you've learned, and what's left to find!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/858cfa2832f4936e8f75ad2fa047cd39.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br><i>&quot;Being a Wizard isn't just about might. A Wizard must be thoughtful, and wise. Never be just a weapon, Talif.&quot;</i><br>Being a Wizard isn't all about strength, a Wizard must also be thoughtful. Use <strong>Consider</strong> on your enemies to learn more about their strengths, weaknesses, and lore.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/81bb7370a7f59429a113fa0b3fdf2555.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Fight through an entire bestiary of monsters as Talif levels up and increases his power. Learn unique traits as Talif progresses through levels that change and modify how he approaches using his <strong>Magic</strong> in combat.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/9c666ccc46424fd76c500d785f77517e.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Talif's <strong>Gloves</strong>, <strong>Helms</strong>, <strong>Cloaks</strong>, and <strong>Accessories</strong> carry special properties, which can augment certain spells or elements. Tailor Talif's gear to meet the needs of the current challenge.",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/747e3a230bcea7a50154eac5341bc0a5.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Talif is an Apprentice on his way to becoming a Wizard. Heed the Archmage and traverse the island's 4 Dungeons, and collect the 4 Elemental Gifts, uncovering the secrets of the Wizard's island.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/f3d10625e8705b9c87b67cc1d86c98b7.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Talif casts magic by using four elemental orbs: fire, earth, water, and wind. Discover scrolls across the island to learn new combinations, and take advantage of your enemies' weaknesses. Check your <strong>Spellbook </strong>to see what you've learned, and what's left to find!<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/858cfa2832f4936e8f75ad2fa047cd39.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br><i>&quot;Being a Wizard isn't just about might. A Wizard must be thoughtful, and wise. Never be just a weapon, Talif.&quot;</i><br>Being a Wizard isn't all about strength, a Wizard must also be thoughtful. Use <strong>Consider</strong> on your enemies to learn more about their strengths, weaknesses, and lore.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/81bb7370a7f59429a113fa0b3fdf2555.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Fight through an entire bestiary of monsters as Talif levels up and increases his power. Learn unique traits as Talif progresses through levels that change and modify how he approaches using his <strong>Magic</strong> in combat.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1145400/extras/9c666ccc46424fd76c500d785f77517e.webp?t=1653922027\" /></div><br>Talif's <strong>Gloves</strong>, <strong>Helms</strong>, <strong>Cloaks</strong>, and <strong>Accessories</strong> carry special properties, which can augment certain spells or elements. Tailor Talif's gear to meet the needs of the current challenge.",
    "short_description": "Join Talif in his journey as he travels to 4 dungeons on his path from Apprentice to Wizard. Call upon earth, fire, water, and air as you master all 4 elements! Combine the elemental orbs to create spells that are greater than the sum of their parts.",
